# Sibling repositories, linked for local development:
#   ln -s ../../<repo>/addons/<addon> addons/<addon>
# dot-core is the one dependency. dot-loadout is linked only so the self-test can run
# DotInvLoadoutLink against the real document; the addon itself never names it.
